# Everything in this repo is consumed inside a Linux container, so nothing here may be
# checked out with CRLF. Windows clones default to core.autocrlf=true, which gave mywine
# a CRLF shebang: the kernel then looks for an interpreter literally named "/bin/sh\r"
# and every invocation fails with the misleading "mywine: not found". Dockerfiles are no
# safer -- CRLF breaks line continuations there.
* text=auto eol=lf
